                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【Albums (lossy)】Dolby Atmos - Lana Del Rey Unreleased new production / Atmos]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/lana-del-rey-unreleased-new-production-atmos.306642/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I’m working on something pretty big.<br>
<br>
The plan is to take as many unreleased Lana Del Rey songs as possible and give them a completely new, contemporary production — new drums, additional instruments, new arrangements, mixing and, in some cases, Dolby Atmos.<br>
<br>
I want to explore what these songs could sound like with a modern production while still keeping the character of the originals.<br>
<br>
I’ll be sharing the project here as it develops, so if there are any unreleased Lana songs you’d especially like to hear reworked, send me your suggestions.<br>
<br>
Let’s see how far we can take this.
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
